Z||000013||Cliff Pennock||01-08-2001||05:33 AM||||I think we should leave the amount of the donation to everybody themselves. In times like these I'm sure every donation helps, be it $5 or $100.<P>Only problem is how to set this up and how to make sure that the donations that are made actually end up where they should. I could create a page where people could enter who they are and how much they have donated. I would of course keep the individual amounts invisible and only display the total amount donated so far and the names of the people who have made a donation.<P>For the person that handles the money I can make an overview so it would be easy to check if all donations have been received.<P>If I were in the States I would be able to handle all donations myself but since this is not the case, we need someone who would be willing to do this.||||reg||1
